      "accessed": "2026-11-28",
      "note": "Alaska's press release (May 2023) and its photos: the right side in the hangar, the nose with the pink line running back from the radome, the fin with the column of pink dots. The colors are named here: Midnight Blue, Atlas Blue, White and Pink."
